=== Trace analysis ===
n=5: transitive trace = 5 * 6 = 30, each TT contributes 3, so 30/3 = 10 TTs = C(5,3)
n=6: transitive trace = 6 * 10 = 60, each TT contributes 3, so 60/3 = 20 TTs = C(6,3)
General: trace(C^T C) = 3 * #TT (each constraint has 3 nonzeros of magnitude 1)
